  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the system of linear equations:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& x_1+2 x_2+x_3=3 \\\\\n& 2 x_1+3 x_2+x_3=3 \\\\\n& 3 x_1+5 x_2+2 x_3=1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThe system has",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "fbEo1",
      "text": "\nexactly 3 solutions\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "L8PIF",
      "text": "\na unique solution\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Sg49c",
      "text": "\nno solution\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lx5Ax",
      "text": "\ninfinite number of solutions",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& D=\\left|\\begin{array}{lll}\n1 & 2 & 1 \\\\\n2 & 3 & 1 \\\\\n3 & 5 & 2\n\\end{array}\\right|=0 \\\\\n& D_1=\\left|\\begin{array}{lll}\n3 & 2 & 1 \\\\\n3 & 3 & 1 \\\\\n1 & 5 & 2\n\\end{array}\\right| \\neq 0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n$\\Rightarrow$ Given system, does not have any solution.\n$\\Rightarrow$ No solution.",
